  "description": "Railer i/O's lightweight SuperCruise Plus 6061 alloy frame with integrated cargo/battery rack, cushy Plus-size 3\" tires and hydraulic disc brakes team up with a powerful 36V 350W rear hub pedal-assist powerplant. The system utilizes Sanyo battery technology with 5 levels of assist and delivers an estimated 30 to 50 miles of range depending on mode. Full recharge time is just 4 hours.\nLightweight alloy SuperCruise Plus i/O frame featuring longer, more laid-back geometry, and clearance for the biggest rubber for the smoothest cruise\nMoto-inspired Railer handlebar for the ultimate statement\nIntegrated rear cargo/battery rack\nPowerful Tektro Auriga hydraulic disc brakes ensure all-condition stopping power\nShimano Tourney 7-speed drivetrain with Revo twist shifter\n3-piece alloy crankset\nRailer Plus 26\" x 3\" tires on super-wide 50mm alloy rims\nRear moto-style shorty fender keeps you clean\ni/O battery/motor system",
